ing wings and opens into","photo":"https://www.vmfa.museum/img/9a5df417-30c0-41e2-a192-6b8804aebafb/STA09967.jpg?fm=jpg&q=80&fit=max&crop=4000%2C2667%2C0%2C0&w=1000","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":1}]},{"name":"Venue Rentals","desc":null,"variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":2}]},{"name":"Studio School Classes","desc":"VMFA’s Studio School offers adults ages 18 and up year-round courses and workshops in drawing, painting, photography, pottery, printmaking, mixed-media, creative writing, design, and yoga. Instructors are professional artists committed to helping adult students of all levels grow","photo":"https://www.vmfa.museum/img/b05a6c02-2e84-45f3-9c24-8c7438a9b6e8/914bad26-58d3-4365-ae42-2d40b5377c5a.jpg?fm=jpg&q=80&fit=max&crop=4200%2C5600%2C0%2C0&w=1000","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":3}]},{"name":"Botanical Drawing [4]","desc":null,"photo":"https://www.vmfa.museum/outbound/medias?w=800&file=images%2FMan-painting-still-life_455.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":5}]},{"name":"Pottery class","desc":null,"photo":"https://www.vmfa.museum/outbound/medias?w=800&file=images%2F52.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":6}]},{"name":"Audio Tour","desc":"Explore highlights of the permanent collection on this audio tour for all","photo":"https://www.vmfa.museum/outbound/medias?w=800&file=images%2FFineArtsFlowersGuidedToursCrop.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":7}]},{"name":"Summer Camps","desc":"VMFA offers week-long summer camps for learners and creators ages 3 to 17. Registration begins every","photo":"https://www.vmfa.museum/img/2475597b-2e41-4092-b4eb-79fd3c071301/E202406_SS_1621_o41.jpg?fm=jpg&q=80&fit=max&crop=2400%2C1350%2C0%2C0&w=1000","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":8}]},{"name":"Jan Hatchette","desc":null,"photo":"https://www.vmfa.museum/img/175860a2-3be5-4414-9fde-5703054b4019/E202505_TF_0